  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EPortAventura World has opened a new steel coaster within Ferrari Land, aimed at a broader family audience alongside the area\u0027s flagship launch coaster. Early visitor feedback has praised the ride\u0027s smooth layout and Formula 1 theming.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
